# Bayshore billboard face overlay. Coordinates in Unreal centimetres, Z up.
# Fits ft_city.billboard(): W=1200 H=600 z0=560, front is -X.
# Align the object origin and transform with the existing SM_Billboard.
# Face is 20 cm toward -X from the origin, clearing its decorative geometry.
# Import at scale 1; verify a 1200 x 600 cm face and -X normal in Unreal.
o SM_BB_FaceOverlay
v -20 -600 560
v -20 -600 1160
v -20 600 1160
v -20 600 560
vt 1 0
vt 1 1
vt 0 1
vt 0 0
vn -1 0 0
s off
f 1/1/1 2/2/1 3/3/1
f 1/1/1 3/3/1 4/4/1
